  "description_short": "Relaxed neighbourhood eatery in Kanonkop serving comfort food, craft beers, and good vibes in a welcoming space.",
  "description_long": "Tucked away in Kanonkop, Knysna Social Eatery lives up to its name as a warm, unpretentious spot where locals and visitors gather over honest food and cold drinks. The menu leans into comfort classics—think hearty burgers, wood-fired pizzas, and plates designed for sharing—all served in a relaxed indoor-outdoor setting that feels more like a friend's place than a formal restaurant.\n\nThe vibe is easygoing and inclusive, with families, couples, and groups all finding their groove here. The bar stocks a decent selection of craft beers and wines, perfect for lingering over lunch or settling in for a lazy afternoon. Located slightly off the main tourist trail, it's a favourite with Knysna residents who appreciate the no-fuss atmosphere and consistent quality.\n\nWhether you're after a casual bite before exploring the Heads or a laid-back dinner spot that won't break the bank, Knysna Social Eatery delivers exactly what it promises—good company, good food, and a genuinely social experience.",
